      "Normal serum histidine levels despite urinary losses",
      "Exclusion of other inherited aminoacidurias and renal tubular disorders"
    ]
  },
  "differentialDiagnoses": [
    {
      "diseaseId": "fanconi-syndrome",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Broader proximal tubular dysfunction with glucosuria, phosphaturia, bicarbonate loss",
